{title: Bind Us Together}
{key: F}

{comment: Chorus}
[F]Bind us [Gm7]together, Lord, [Am7]Bind us [Dm7]together
with [Gm7]chords [Bb/C]that cannot be [F]bro[Bb/C]ken
[F]Bind us [Gm7]together, Lord, [Am7]bind us [Dm7]together,
[Gm7]Bind us [Bb/C]together [F]with love.

{comment: Verse}
[F]There is [Gm7]only [Am7]one [Gm7]God,
[F]There [Bb/C]is only [F]one King,
[F]There is [Gm7]only [Am7]one [Gm7]body,
[F]That is why we sing.
